agda-wasm-builds: release agda-2.9.0-da66a8c-als-8

The files of this release are WebAssembly builds of free software, made
by the formalverification organization from the public sources that
README.md names.  This notice says what each binary contains and under
which license; the license texts are in licenses/, each copied verbatim
from its source.

