2.  The language server as a reactor: als-reactor.wasm, als-reactor.js

    als-reactor.wasm (SHA-256
    a0c7ae5741dd3f11c6be9e9fac4281889f2861ec2b53b5379452d11a4a23e8c9) is
    the same build with the server's reactor flag.  It contains everything
    section 1 lists, and one Haskell package more, ghc-experimental
    9.1003.0, GHC's JavaScript FFI: BSD-3-Clause, the Glasgow Haskell
    Compiler License, licenses/haskell/ghc-experimental-9.1003.0/LICENSE.
    Its plan is plan-als-reactor.json.

    als-reactor.js (SHA-256
