3.  Agda: agda.wasm

    agda.wasm (SHA-256
    da2f1efc6b13e0d8b8a69311511c8ed6fbfbc2759bd8ec299004580fcfba1eb1) is
    Agda 2.9.0's own executable, built from agda/agda at the commit of
    section 1 in Agda's own project (with amesgen/splitmix at
    cea9e31bdd849eb0c17611bb99e33d590e126164, which that project names
    for wasm32), at the same index state and with the same toolchain, and
    statically linked.  Its plan is plan-agda.json.  It contains Agda
    (1.2), GHC's runtime system and boot libraries (1.3), GMP (1.4), the
    C and C++ libraries of 1.6, and the Haskell packages of its plan's
    link closure: 109 packages, each of them among those 1.5 lists except
    four at other versions, QuickCheck 2.19.0.0, aeson 2.3.2.0, splitmix
    0.1.1 and text-iso8601 0.2.0.0.  Each of the four is under the license
    1.5 gives its other version, with the same text except aeson's
    copyright years (2014-2026), and its license file is in
    licenses/haskell/<name>-<version>/.
